  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 4 and 6; ÷ and +\n\n**Given:******\n\n46 × 6 + 32 – 12 ÷ 8 = –34****\n\n**After interchange the signs;******\n\n64 × __**4 **____**÷**____** 32**__ – 12 + 8 = –36****\n\n**By BODMAS rule******\n\n**__64 × 0.125__** – 12 + 8 = –36\n\n**__8__** – 12 __**+ 8**__ = –36\n\n**__16 – 12__** = -36****\n\n**4 = -36 ****(LHS ≠ RHS)******\n\n**Option 2 :** 3 and 2; × and –\n\nGiven: \n\n46 × 6 + 32 – 12 ÷ 8 = –34\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n46 - 6 + 23 × **__13 ÷ 8__** = –24\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n46 - 6 + __**23 **____**×**____** 1.625**__ = –24\n\n**__46__** - 6 __**+ 37.375**__ = –24\n\n__**83.375 - 6**__ = –24\n\n77.375 = -24** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **6 and 2; + and ×\n\nGiven:\n\n46 × 6 + 32 – 12 ÷ 8 = –34\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n42 + 2 × 36 – **__16 ÷ 8__** = –34\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n42 + __**2 **____**×**____** 36**__ – 2 = –34\n\n__42 + 72__ – 2 = –34\n\n**114 – 2** = –34\n\n112 = -34 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **8 and 6; ÷ and ×\n\n**Given:**\n\n**46 × 6 + 32 – 12 ÷ 8 = –34******\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n__**48 **__**__÷____ 8__ + 32 – 12 × 6 = –34**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**6 + 32 – __12 __****__×____ 6__ = –34**\n\n**__6 + 32__ – 72 = –34**\n\n**__38 – 72__ = –34******\n\n**-34 = -34** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****8 and 6; ÷ and ×**”.****",
